{"version":1,"content":"<p>過氣緋聞男女周嘉洛與陳瀅今晚（18日）以黑白配襯到絕的造型，翹住手齊行台慶的紅地氈。</p><p>兩人接受訪問時被讚是「螢幕CP」， 陳瀅表示：「我哋真係好耐冇合體，真係好開心大家都鍾意我哋呢一Pair，一齊行係公司安排。</p><p>」周嘉洛就話跟陳瀅合體是求之不得</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:37:10.031083+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:46:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:29.445213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:29.445213+00:00","content_hash":"757c0ed69da05de6863d49d06f7d00c056cac9b371d47bf40596b2ca4a741bbb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}